# PROJECT: KISHAN BHAI — HOME / OVERVIEW PAGE

Act as a senior UI/UX designer, product designer, React developer, and full-stack engineer specializing in modern AgriTech platforms.

Design and implement a beautiful, premium, responsive, and functional Home / Overview Page for **Kishan Bhai**, an AI-powered agricultural platform built to help Indian farmers increase their market access, reduce farming costs, connect with verified buyers, and manage agricultural activities more efficiently.

The platform connects farmers, agricultural buyers, industries, suppliers, machinery owners, and Village Champions.

**Tagline:** Small Farms. One Powerful Network.

## IMPORTANT DEVELOPMENT RULES

1. First inspect the existing Kishan Bhai project.
2. Understand its frontend framework, backend, database, authentication, routes, and existing features.
3. Integrate the Home / Overview Page into the existing application.
4. Do not rebuild the application from scratch.
5. Do not delete or break existing features.
6. Reuse existing components, APIs, authentication, and database models wherever possible.
7. Do not create duplicate pages, routes, database tables, or components unnecessarily.
8. Do not use fake live data, fabricated buyer offers, fake market prices, or fake user statistics.
9. Connect features to the real backend when available.
10. If an integration is missing, show an honest unavailable state instead of pretending the feature works.
11. Focus on the Home / Overview Page and its navigation to existing features.
12. Do not implement blockchain or x402 payment functionality.

